/.playwright-mcp/

# Built documentation. `docs:build-html` regenerates both from database/docs, and
# together they are ~930MB — a single `git add -A` would put that in history for
# good. The release build generates documentation/docs.html into its own staging
# tree, so nothing here needs to ship from the repo.
/docs/html/
/docs/makeai-docs.zip

# Saved page renders from debugging. These are dumps of authenticated admin pages
# (they carry the CSRF token of whoever produced them) and they sit in the webroot,
# where anything not matched by the front-controller rewrite is served as a file.
/public/dump_*.html
